cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them using the metadata from this file."
title: "HACS census of Hecke algebras and modules in the cohomology of SL_2(Z)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Januszewski
    given-names: Fabian
    email: fabian.januszewski@math.uni-paderborn.de
    affiliation: "Universität Paderborn"
abstract: >-
  Census data computed with HACS (Harder Arithmetic Cohomology System): the congruence census, the integral census and
  the integral Hecke structure data set HeckeZ (editions 1 and 2) for the cohomology of SL_2(Z) and of Gamma_0(N) with
  coefficients in the symmetric powers of the standard representation. The data sets are versioned by edition (EDITIONS.md); the edition
  shown in each table's header is the one to cite.
license: CC-BY-4.0
